  "decision_conditions": [
    "The development hereby permitted shall be commenced before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.<br>",
    "<p>The development hereby approved shall only be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans and documents:</p><p>- DRAWING XXX REV XX DATED XX<br>- USE [SHIFT]+[ENTER] FOR REGULAR LINE SPACING<br>- USE [ENTER] FOR LARGER LINE SPACING</p><p>No other drawings or documents apply.</p>",
    "<p class=\"MsoNormal\">The materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the development hereby permitted shall match those used in the existing dwellinghouse.<br></p>",
    "<p>The outbuilding hereby approved shall only be used for purposes incidental to the enjoyment of the dwellinghouse as such. It shall not be used for purposes conflicting with the use of the property as a single dwellinghouse, and in particular it shall not be used as a separate unit of accommodation.</p>",
    "&lt;p&gt;The primary access to the proposed outbuilding shall be via the door fronting onto the garden and via the main dwellinghouse. The rear fire escape door and garden access gate shall remain secondary and shall only be used in case of emergency.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Reason: To protect the character and appearance of the surrounding area, to safeguard the living conditions of neighbouring occupiers and to ensure that the building is not used as self-contained accommodation, which may give rise to substandard living conditions.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
